abstract: "Streamlit dashboard for assessing the quality of medical image segmentation, reporting Dice, IoU, Hausdorff distance, uncertainty, sensitivity and regional performance. Used as the evaluation companion to the TriFuse-SRNet cardiac MRI segmentation work."
